{
  "format": "manosaba.story",
  "version": 1,
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "path": "Act02_Chapter03/Act02_Chapter03_Adv01",
  "events": [
    {"op": "GosubResetWitchBook", "line": 1, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_ResetWitchBook"}},
    {"op": "Gosub", "line": 2, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_Subroutine.BeginAdv"}},
    {"op": "label", "name": "Scene2-3-1", "line": 8, "indent": 0},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 14, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": [3.5], "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [31.0, 72.0], "AppearanceAndTransition": "26_1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 15, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000", "Duration": 1.2000000476837158, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "Transparent", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 16, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.8"}},
    {"op": "PlayBgm", "line": 18, "indent": 0, "params": {"BgmPath": "Bgm_26_1", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 1, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 20, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "那一天，我独自来到冷冻室。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 22, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这几天我东奔西走，循着奈叶香托付给我的情报，<br>\n重新对监牢进行了一番调查。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 24, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "为的就是找出关于这一切的罪魁祸首——<br>\n【大魔女】的线索。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 26, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（棘手的是，无法在这里久留）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 28, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "体感温度大概是零下20度左右吧。<br>\n嘴里吐出的都是白气，凛冽的寒气仿佛刀子一般割着脸。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 30, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "忍受着这深入骨髓的寒冷，<br>\n我打着冷颤把冷冻室大致调查了一遍。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative005"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCamera", "line": 32, "indent": 0, "params": {"Offset": [5.0], "Duration": 1.0, "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 34, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这里最令人无法移开视线的，<br>\n是那些被冰封的魔女。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 36, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "而且，不知出于何种意图，<br>\n连那些遭到杀害的少女也同样被冰封在这里。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 38, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "也就是说……这无数冰块，正昭示着发生过无数场悲剧。<br>\n有多少悲剧，就有多少恐惧和悲哀。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 40, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（玛格和奈叶香，还有可可也在这里面……）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 42, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（……不，现在不能沉溺于感伤）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro003"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 44, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 45, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": [3.0], "TintColor": "#00000000", "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 46, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000FF", "Duration": 0.6000000238418579, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 47, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.6"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 49, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我离开陈列着一排排冰块的区域，<br>\n站在巨大保险箱面前。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative009"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 51, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 54, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_134", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 56, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "2"}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 59, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_62", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCamera", "line": 61, "indent": 0, "params": {"Offset": [-17.5, -4.0], "Zoom": 0.4000000059604645, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 62, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "2"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 63, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#00000000", "Duration": 0.5, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 64, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 66, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我输入密码解锁，打开了保险箱的门。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 68, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这里面原本<br>\n应该存放着一些【杀死魔女的药】才对。<br>\n就是可可带在身上，而且玛格也使用过的那种药。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative011"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 70, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "可那药品已经一个不留，全都消失得无影无踪。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative012"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 72, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "包括可可曾经拥有的那些，<br>\n都被典狱长收走了。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative013"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 74, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "关于药品的去向，<br>\n典狱长已经在工作报告中提到过了。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative014"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 76, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "『既然【特雷德基姆】已经被各位发现，<br>\n　那么，对于这种有可能促进杀人行为的危险品……』", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative015"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 78, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "『我会全数收走，并适当处分的』", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative016"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 80, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "因此，保险箱里剩下的只有<br>\n被用于杀害梅露露的那把剑。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative017"]}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 85, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Clue", "Params": ["6-2"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 87, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（说起来，这把剑……<br>\n　好像本来就放在这个保险箱里。<br>\n　它是不是有什么特殊含义呢）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 89, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（到刚才为止，我都只把它当成是一件<br>\n　【作案凶器】……）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 91, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（但回头仔细一想，<br>\n　就开始觉得这应该是很重要的东西）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 93, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我把剑拿起来，仔细端详了一会。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative018"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 95, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "剑身外饰的精美程度，<br>\n使人不禁联想到，它很可能不仅仅只是一把普通的武器。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative019"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 97, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（也有可能是某种和大魔女相关的物件，<br>\n　但只看外表也看不出什么来）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 99, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（说不定继续深入调查下去<br>\n　就能发现什么蛛丝马迹来。<br>\n　不管怎样，现在要紧的是找出线索）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro008"]}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 101, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Clue", "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "StopBgm", "line": 102, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 103, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 104, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000FF", "Duration": 0.5, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 105, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 106, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_62", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 107, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 109, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我把剑放回保险箱，并关上了门。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative020"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 111, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（……感觉五脏六腑都要冰透了。<br>\n　差不多该去调查其他地方了）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro009"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 113, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 115, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": {"expression": "{g_backgroundDefaultScale}"}, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0, 50.0], "AppearanceAndTransition": "25_1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCamera", "line": 116, "indent": 0, "params": {"Offset": [0.0], "Zoom": 0.0, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PlayBgm", "line": 118, "indent": 0, "params": {"BgmPath": "Bgm_26_2", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 1, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 120, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#00000000", "Duration": 1.0, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 121, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.2"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 123, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "走到隔壁的操作室后，<br>\n我拿出自己的手机。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative021"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 125, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "奈叶香发给我的录像已经看过很多次了。<br>\n但我还是再次播放起来。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative022"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 127, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 128, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000FF", "Duration": 0.5, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 129, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "ModifyTextPrinter", "line": 131, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Normal.Stream", "MakeDefault": 1, "HideOther": 1}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 132, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": {"expression": "{g_backgroundDefaultScale}"}, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "24_1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 133, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Nanoka.Default"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 134, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#00000000", "Duration": 0.800000011920929, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 135, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.8"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 139, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——自从来到这座监牢以后，<br>\n我独自进行了各种各样的调查。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 143, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "可是，只靠我一人，<br>\n最终还是没能找出任何关于幕后黑手的情报。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 147, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我之所以能知道真相——", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka003"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 149, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 150, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.8999999761581421, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 151, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.2"}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 152, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyTextPrinter", "line": 153, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Normal.Default", "MakeDefault": 1, "HideOther": 1}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 155, "indent": 0, "params": {"Id": "Stills", "Scale": {"expression": "{g_backgroundDefaultScale}"}, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "330_1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 157, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.800000011920929, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "Transparent", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 158, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.9"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 162, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "是因为我杀死了泽渡可可。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka004"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 164, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.8999999761581421, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 165, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.2"}},
    {"op": "HidePrinter", "line": 166, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "HideActors", "line": 167, "indent": 0, "params": {"ActorIds": ["Stills"], "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyTextPrinter", "line": 168, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Normal.Default", "MakeDefault": 1, "HideOther": 1}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 170, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": {"expression": "{g_backgroundDefaultScale}"}, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "25_1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 172, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.800000011920929, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "Transparent", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 173, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.9"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 175, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（无法抑制的杀人冲动……<br>\n　奈叶香的魔女化就是在那时一下子加深了的吧）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 177, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（而魔女化程度越深，<br>\n　魔法能力也会随之爆发性增强）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro011"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 179, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 180, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000FF", "Duration": 0.5, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 181, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "ModifyTextPrinter", "line": 183, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Normal.Stream", "MakeDefault": 1, "HideOther": 1}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 184, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": {"expression": "{g_backgroundDefaultScale}"}, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "24_1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 185, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Nanoka.Default"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 186, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#00000000", "Duration": 0.5, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 187, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 191, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我的【幻视】能让我看到一些<br>\n跟监牢的秘密相关的情景。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka005"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 193, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "HidePrinter", "line": 194, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 195, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000FF", "Duration": 0.20000000298023224, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 196, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.2"}},
    {"op": "ModifyTextPrinter", "line": 197, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Normal.Default", "MakeDefault": 1, "HideOther": 1}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 199, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "在背后引导魔女审判和杀人的幕后黑手，梅露露。<br>\n原来她所做的一切都是为了这个目的——找出【大魔女】的所在。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative023"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 204, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": {"expression": "{g_backgroundDefaultScale}"}, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "5_1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 205, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Meruru.Default"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 206, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#00000000", "Duration": 1.0, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 207, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.2"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 209, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我我我、我的名字是、冰、冰、冰……<br>\n冰上、梅露露……", "AuthorId": "Meruru", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Meruru001"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 211, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 212, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000FF", "Duration": 0.5, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 213, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 214, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 215, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": {"expression": "{g_backgroundDefaultScale}"}, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "26_1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 220, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#00000000", "Duration": 1.0, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 221, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 223, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（跟梅露露相处的时间实在太短。<br>\n　如果能再相处久一点，<br>\n　我是不是就能想像出她的心情？）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro012"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 225, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（不——根本没必要去理解魔女在想什么）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro013"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 227, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我摇了摇头，注意力转回录像之上。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative024"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 229, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 231, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 232, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000FF", "Duration": 0.5, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 233, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "ModifyTextPrinter", "line": 236, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Normal.Stream", "MakeDefault": 1, "HideOther": 1}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 237, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": {"expression": "{g_backgroundDefaultScale}"}, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "24_1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 238, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Nanoka.Default"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 239, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#00000000", "Duration": 0.5, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 240, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 242, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "魔女因子浓度高的少女，<br>\n有可能会在15岁以后一口气魔女化。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 244, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "在魔女因子的检查中检测出高数值的女孩会被集中起来，<br>\n这座监牢就是用来收容她们的地方。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 246, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "本来按规定，<br>\n国家机关会在我们完全变成魔女前把我们全部诛杀。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 248, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "可讽刺的是，<br>\n正因为冰上梅露露想利用我们找到大魔女，<br>\n我们才得以在夹缝中生存下来。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka009"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 250, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Nanoka.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 252, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "奈叶香说出这些话以后，<br>\n突然捂着脸发出痛苦的呻吟。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative025"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 254, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "拍下这份录像时，<br>\n奈叶香应该正饱受魔女化程度加深的折磨吧。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative026"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 256, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "就算是这样，冰上梅露露的所作所为<br>\n也不可原谅……", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 258, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……我本想，亲手杀了她……", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka011"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 260, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "…………", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro014"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 262, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "虽然不知道是什么原因让她这么想，<br>\n冰上梅露露好像认为，<br>\n大魔女就潜伏在我们这些拥有【魔女因子】的少女之中。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka012"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 264, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "就为了促进我们的魔女化进程，<br>\n她诱导我们互相厮杀，举行魔女审判——", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka013"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 266, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——执行了无数凄惨的处决。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative027"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 268, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "她相信，这样下去，终有一天会找到大魔女。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative028"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 270, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Nanoka.Angry1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 272, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……我绝对不会原谅她。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka014"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 274, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "从奈叶香的低语中渗出的决心，<br>\n让我也感到一阵痛楚。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative029"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 276, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "过了一会，应该是想重振精神吧，<br>\n奈叶香轻轻地吐了一口气。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative030"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 278, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Nanoka.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 280, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "呼……对不起。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka015"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 282, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "冰上梅露露已经死了。<br>\n我现在想要说的并不是冰上梅露露的事。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka016"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 284, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我们应该找到的是——大魔女。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka017"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 286, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "虽然不清楚她在哪里，<br>\n甚至不知道她到底是否至今仍然存在于世……", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka018"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 288, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "但人类之所以会变成魔女，<br>\n都是因为大魔女在全世界散布【魔女因子】。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka019"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 290, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——向全世界散播的诅咒。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative031"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 292, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这诅咒有如病毒一般蔓延扩散，<br>\n带来无数的悲剧与死亡。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative032"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 294, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这一切的罪魁祸首，就是不知道身在何处的大魔女。", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka020"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 296, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "但反过来说，<br>\n也许只要找到大魔女，就能解除我们身上的诅咒。<br>\n消灭诅咒的源头，或者是……", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka021"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 298, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "抱歉，我给不出一个准确的说法——", "AuthorId": "Nanoka", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Nanoka022"]}},
    {"op": "HidePrinter", "line": 300, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 301, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000FF", "Duration": 0.5, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 302, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 304, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyTextPrinter", "line": 305, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Normal.Default", "MakeDefault": 1, "HideOther": 1}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 307, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": {"expression": "{g_backgroundDefaultScale}"}, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "25_1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 309, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#00000000", "Duration": 0.5, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 310, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 312, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "看到这里，我关闭了录像，攥紧了手机。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative033"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 314, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（……一定要消灭这罪恶的源头）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro015"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 316, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "被囚禁的一众少女已经是受害者了，<br>\n绝不能让无辜的人再这样继续牺牲。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative034"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 318, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（我要亲手找出大魔女，裁决她）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Hiro016"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 320, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这才是我应当贯彻的道路。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0203Adv01_Narrative035"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 322, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000FF", "Duration": 1.0, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 323, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.2"}},
    {"op": "Gosub", "line": 325, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv"}},
    {"op": "GotoModified", "line": 327, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Act02_Chapter03/Act02_Chapter03_Adv02", "SoftReset": 1}}
  ],
  "translations": {
  "0203Adv01_Narrative001": "那一天，我独自来到冷冻室。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative002": "这几天我东奔西走，循着奈叶香托付给我的情报，<br>\n重新对监牢进行了一番调查。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative003": "为的就是找出关于这一切的罪魁祸首——<br>\n【大魔女】的线索。",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro001": "（棘手的是，无法在这里久留）",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative004": "体感温度大概是零下20度左右吧。<br>\n嘴里吐出的都是白气，凛冽的寒气仿佛刀子一般割着脸。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative005": "忍受着这深入骨髓的寒冷，<br>\n我打着冷颤把冷冻室大致调查了一遍。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative006": "这里最令人无法移开视线的，<br>\n是那些被冰封的魔女。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative007": "而且，不知出于何种意图，<br>\n连那些遭到杀害的少女也同样被冰封在这里。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative008": "也就是说……这无数冰块，正昭示着发生过无数场悲剧。<br>\n有多少悲剧，就有多少恐惧和悲哀。",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro002": "（玛格和奈叶香，还有可可也在这里面……）",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro003": "（……不，现在不能沉溺于感伤）",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative009": "我离开陈列着一排排冰块的区域，<br>\n站在巨大保险箱面前。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative010": "我输入密码解锁，打开了保险箱的门。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative011": "这里面原本<br>\n应该存放着一些【杀死魔女的药】才对。<br>\n就是可可带在身上，而且玛格也使用过的那种药。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative012": "可那药品已经一个不留，全都消失得无影无踪。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative013": "包括可可曾经拥有的那些，<br>\n都被典狱长收走了。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative014": "关于药品的去向，<br>\n典狱长已经在工作报告中提到过了。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative015": "『既然【特雷德基姆】已经被各位发现，<br>\n　那么，对于这种有可能促进杀人行为的危险品……』",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative016": "『我会全数收走，并适当处分的』",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative017": "因此，保险箱里剩下的只有<br>\n被用于杀害梅露露的那把剑。",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro004": "（说起来，这把剑……<br>\n　好像本来就放在这个保险箱里。<br>\n　它是不是有什么特殊含义呢）",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro005": "（到刚才为止，我都只把它当成是一件<br>\n　【作案凶器】……）",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro006": "（但回头仔细一想，<br>\n　就开始觉得这应该是很重要的东西）",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative018": "我把剑拿起来，仔细端详了一会。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative019": "剑身外饰的精美程度，<br>\n使人不禁联想到，它很可能不仅仅只是一把普通的武器。",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro007": "（也有可能是某种和大魔女相关的物件，<br>\n　但只看外表也看不出什么来）",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro008": "（说不定继续深入调查下去<br>\n　就能发现什么蛛丝马迹来。<br>\n　不管怎样，现在要紧的是找出线索）",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative020": "我把剑放回保险箱，并关上了门。",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro009": "（……感觉五脏六腑都要冰透了。<br>\n　差不多该去调查其他地方了）",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative021": "走到隔壁的操作室后，<br>\n我拿出自己的手机。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative022": "奈叶香发给我的录像已经看过很多次了。<br>\n但我还是再次播放起来。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka001": "——自从来到这座监牢以后，<br>\n我独自进行了各种各样的调查。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka002": "可是，只靠我一人，<br>\n最终还是没能找出任何关于幕后黑手的情报。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka003": "我之所以能知道真相——",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka004": "是因为我杀死了泽渡可可。",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro010": "（无法抑制的杀人冲动……<br>\n　奈叶香的魔女化就是在那时一下子加深了的吧）",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro011": "（而魔女化程度越深，<br>\n　魔法能力也会随之爆发性增强）",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka005": "我的【幻视】能让我看到一些<br>\n跟监牢的秘密相关的情景。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative023": "在背后引导魔女审判和杀人的幕后黑手，梅露露。<br>\n原来她所做的一切都是为了这个目的——找出【大魔女】的所在。",
  "0203Adv01_Meruru001": "我我我、我的名字是、冰、冰、冰……<br>\n冰上、梅露露……",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro012": "（跟梅露露相处的时间实在太短。<br>\n　如果能再相处久一点，<br>\n　我是不是就能想像出她的心情？）",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro013": "（不——根本没必要去理解魔女在想什么）",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative024": "我摇了摇头，注意力转回录像之上。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka006": "魔女因子浓度高的少女，<br>\n有可能会在15岁以后一口气魔女化。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka007": "在魔女因子的检查中检测出高数值的女孩会被集中起来，<br>\n这座监牢就是用来收容她们的地方。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka008": "本来按规定，<br>\n国家机关会在我们完全变成魔女前把我们全部诛杀。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka009": "可讽刺的是，<br>\n正因为冰上梅露露想利用我们找到大魔女，<br>\n我们才得以在夹缝中生存下来。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative025": "奈叶香说出这些话以后，<br>\n突然捂着脸发出痛苦的呻吟。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative026": "拍下这份录像时，<br>\n奈叶香应该正饱受魔女化程度加深的折磨吧。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka010": "就算是这样，冰上梅露露的所作所为<br>\n也不可原谅……",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka011": "……我本想，亲手杀了她……",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro014": "…………",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka012": "虽然不知道是什么原因让她这么想，<br>\n冰上梅露露好像认为，<br>\n大魔女就潜伏在我们这些拥有【魔女因子】的少女之中。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka013": "就为了促进我们的魔女化进程，<br>\n她诱导我们互相厮杀，举行魔女审判——",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative027": "——执行了无数凄惨的处决。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative028": "她相信，这样下去，终有一天会找到大魔女。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka014": "……我绝对不会原谅她。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative029": "从奈叶香的低语中渗出的决心，<br>\n让我也感到一阵痛楚。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative030": "过了一会，应该是想重振精神吧，<br>\n奈叶香轻轻地吐了一口气。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka015": "呼……对不起。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka016": "冰上梅露露已经死了。<br>\n我现在想要说的并不是冰上梅露露的事。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka017": "我们应该找到的是——大魔女。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka018": "虽然不清楚她在哪里，<br>\n甚至不知道她到底是否至今仍然存在于世……",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka019": "但人类之所以会变成魔女，<br>\n都是因为大魔女在全世界散布【魔女因子】。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative031": "——向全世界散播的诅咒。",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative032": "这诅咒有如病毒一般蔓延扩散，<br>\n带来无数的悲剧与死亡。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka020": "这一切的罪魁祸首，就是不知道身在何处的大魔女。",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka021": "但反过来说，<br>\n也许只要找到大魔女，就能解除我们身上的诅咒。<br>\n消灭诅咒的源头，或者是……",
  "0203Adv01_Nanoka022": "抱歉，我给不出一个准确的说法——",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative033": "看到这里，我关闭了录像，攥紧了手机。",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro015": "（……一定要消灭这罪恶的源头）",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative034": "被囚禁的一众少女已经是受害者了，<br>\n绝不能让无辜的人再这样继续牺牲。",
  "0203Adv01_Hiro016": "（我要亲手找出大魔女，裁决她）",
  "0203Adv01_Narrative035": "这才是我应当贯彻的道路。"
}
}
